msgstr "普通"

#: templates/nabairqualityd/animations_help.html:19
msgid "Good"
msgstr "良い"

#: templates/nabairqualityd/rfid-data.html:5
msgid ""
"When Nabaztag sees that NFC tag it will give you information about air "
"quality. It's as simple as that."
msgstr "NabaztagがそのNFCタグを見ると、大気質の情報を教えてくれます。とても簡単です。"

#: templates/nabairqualityd/settings.html:9
msgid "The "
msgstr ""

#: templates/nabairqualityd/settings.html:9
msgid "visual animation"
msgstr "ビジュアルアニメーション"

#: templates/nabairqualityd/settings.html:9
msgid ""
" displays air quality information based on the location selected for "
"Weather. You can select the type of information you want : Aggregate index "
"(AQI) or just particulate matter (PM 2.5)."
msgstr "は、天気で選択した場所に基づいて大気質の情報を表示します。表示する情報の種類として、総合指数（AQI）または粒子状物質（PM 2.5）のみを選べます。"

#: templates/nabairqualityd/settings.html:10
msgid "You can also "
msgstr "また、"

#: templates/nabairqualityd/settings.html:10
msgid "Speech recognition"
msgstr "音声認識"

#: templates/nabairqualityd/settings.html:10
msgid "ask your rabbit"
msgstr "ウサギに尋ねることもできます"

#: templates/nabairqualityd/settings.html:10
msgid " by saying such things as <q>What is the air quality today ?</q>."
msgstr "。たとえば <q>今日の大気質は？</q> と話しかけてください。"

